Literature already contains something remarkably close to a developmental cognitive library.

Archetypes preserve policies.

Plotlines preserve trajectory geometries.

Tropes preserve causal operators.

Motifs preserve semantic telemetry.

Symbols preserve compressed addresses.

Themes preserve hypotheses.

